# Framework smoke: driving the real telnet session handler in-process.
# Account creation must reach the world, and `look` must render the room.
# Uses only the bare framework world (a fallback spawn room) — no game content.

> create
> tester
> secretpass
> secretpass
expect: Account created

# In the world now: look should render the fallback spawn room, not an error.
> look
expect: Spawn
expect-not: Unknown command
